    "The socket is owned by `root:docker` with `srw-rw----` permissions — only root and members of the `docker` group can access it. IntelliJ runs as your user, so check if your user is in the `docker` group:\n\n```bash\ngroups $USER\n```\n\nIf `docker` is not listed, add yourself:\n\n```bash\nsudo usermod -aG docker $USER\n```\n\nThen **log out and back in** (group membership changes don't apply to existing sessions). Restart IntelliJ after that.\n\nYou can verify it worked without logging out first with:\n\n```bash\nnewgrp docker\ndocker ps\n```\n[Tool uses: none]",
